{"unit_id":"yumm007__dsh-reveal-files#card-card-zh","repo":"yumm007/dsh-reveal-files","commit":"328917ff210ed2ec7f674dda386f2de39fd59bfb","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-reveal-files 是面向 DSH Web 的文件交互插件，在助手消息的产物行中加入文件菜单。它接入 turnTail 展示生成文件，并通过 Host 路由提供在默认应用中打开、复制路径、在本机文件浏览器定位和在终端打开文件目录等操作。相对路径按会话工作目录解析，菜单提供中英文标签和操作错误提示，适合需要继续处理 DSH 生成文件的用户。运行需要 Node.js 22.6 或更高版本及可用的桌面环境。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:294-308","lib/index.js:233-252","lib/index.js:163-168"]}
{"unit_id":"yumm007__dsh-reveal-files#card-card-en","repo":"yumm007/dsh-reveal-files","commit":"328917ff210ed2ec7f674dda386f2de39fd59bfb","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-reveal-files adds actions to DSH Web’s produced-file row: open a file, copy its path, reveal it in the native browser, or open its directory in a terminal. Relative paths use the session working directory. It requires Node.js 22.6 or later.","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:294-308","lib/index.js:233-252","lib/index.js:163-168"]}
